eading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\",\"children\":\"Software Developer focused on building reliable backend systems and AI-powered applications, with hands-on experience across Python, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, Celery, and Docker.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"max-w-2xl text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\",\"children\":\"Built and shipped backend systems involving REST APIs, authentication, asynchronous processing, background task queues, concurrent workflows, database persistence, and AI/ML model integration.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"max-w-2xl text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\",\"children\":\"Built CareerLens, a 21-endpoint FastAPI backend with JWT authentication, RBAC, refresh-token rotation, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, and Redis-backed Celery workflows for parallel LLM processing.\"}],\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\"]}]]}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\"]}],null,\"$L12\"]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{\"children\":\"$L14\"}],null],[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$L17\"}]}]}]]}]\n32:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n34:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\nd:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"max-w-2xl text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\",\"children\":\"Developed AI systems ranging from agentic research and RAG pipelines using LangChain, pgvector, HuggingFace, and Mistral AI to ML applications involving credit-risk prediction, SHAP explainability, and PyTorch-based computer vision.\"}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"max-w-2xl text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\",\"children\":\"Comfortable working across the stack with React, Next.js, AWS, Docker, CI/CD, and REST APIs, while primarily interested in backend engineering, AI integration